</nav></div></header><main><section class="zk-hero"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-eyebrow">USE CASES</div><h1>Design the Workforce Edge Around the Work.</h1><p>Explore the considerations that shape workforce data collection across different industries, workforce models and operating environments.</p></div></section><section class="zk-section"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-section-head"><div class="zk-eyebrow">WORKFORCE ENVIRONMENTS</div><h2>Different Workforces Need Different Collection.</h2><p>Match collection to the environment, employee workflow, labor data, authentication, connectivity and policy requirements.</p></div><div class="zk-grid-3"><article class="zk-card"><div class="zk-tag">INDUSTRY</div><h3>Manufacturing</h3><p>High-throughput punching, labor allocation, rugged environments, badge/biometric choice, job transfers and resilient connectivity.</p></article><article class="zk-card"><div class="zk-tag">INDUSTRY</div><h3>Healthcare</h3><p>Distributed locations, complex schedules, employee identity, time &amp; labor controls, staffing considerations and 24/7 operations.</p></article><article class="zk-card"><div class="zk-tag">INDUSTRY</div><h3>Distribution &amp; Warehousing</h3><p>High-volume shift changes, rugged operating areas, reliable connectivity, fast authentication and labor movement.</p></article><article class="zk-card"><div class="zk-tag">INDUSTRY</div><h3>Retail &amp; Hospitality</h3><p>Multiple sites, changing workforces, shared devices, easy employee interaction and flexible credential strategies.</p></article><article class="zk-card"><div class="zk-tag">WORKFORCE</div><h3>Field &amp; Distributed Workforces</h3><p>A mix of clocks, mobile, web or other approved collection methods depending on workforce location and operational requirements.</p></article><article class="zk-card"><div class="zk-tag">TIME &amp; LABOR</div><h3>Complex Labor Environments</h3><p>Projects, departments, cost centers, worktags, positions, transfers and other labor dimensions that may need to be captured at the source.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="zk-section alt"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-section-head"><div class="zk-eyebrow">DESIGN PRINCIPLE</div><h2>Start With the Workforce—not the Device.</h2><p>Start with the operating requirement. Then choose the collection method, authentication, integration and device that fit.</p></div><div class="zk-actions"><a class="zk-btn primary" href="contact">Discuss Your Use Case</a><a class="zk-btn secondary" href="thought-leadership">Explore Related Insights</a></div></div></section></main><footer class="zk-global-footer"><div class="zk-footer-shell"><div class="zk-footer-grid"><div class="zk-footer-brand"><strong>ZKTeco WFM</strong><p>The Workforce Data Collection Company.<br/>Every Punch Matters.</p></div><div class="zk-footer-col"><h4>Solutions</h4><a href="workday">Workday Customers</a><a href="software-partners">Software Partners</a><a href="use-cases">Industry Use Cases</a><a href="customer-stories">Customer Stories</a></div><div class="zk-footer-col"><h4>Products</h4><a href="ultima-series">Ultima Series</a><a href="timetrack">TimeTrack</a><a href="cirrusconnect">CirrusConnect</a><a href="workday#cirrusdcs">CirrusDCS</a></div><div class="zk-footer-col"><h4>Resources &amp; Trust</h4><a href="resources">Resource Hub</a><a href="thought-leadership">Thought Leadership</a><a href="security-trust">Security &amp; Trust</a><span aria-disabled="true" class="zk-link-disabled">Trust Center — Coming Soon</span><a href="support">Support</a></div><div class="zk-footer-col"><h4>Company</h4><a href="why-zkteco-wfm">Why ZKTeco WFM</a><a href="contact">Contact</a><a href="https://zktecowfm.com/careers/">Careers</a><a href="https://zktecowfm.com/events/">Events</a><a href="https://zktecowfm.com/biometric-privacy-policy/">Biometric Privacy</a></div></div><div class="zk-footer-bottom"><span>© 2026 ZKTeco WFM. All rights reserved.</span><div class="zk-footer-legal"><a href="privacy">Privacy &amp; GDPR</a><a href="cookie-policy">Cookies</a><button data-cookie-setti